											</h2>
				
					<p class="post-meta"><span class="published">May 17, 2026</span></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner"><p>WHEREAS, Emergency Medical Services (EMS) are a vital component of public health and safety, and reliable access to fast, quality emergency medical care dramatically improves survival and recovery for individuals experiencing sudden, life-threatening illness or...</p>
</div><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/emergency-medical-services-week-2026/" class="more-link">read more</a></div>			
			</article>
				
			<article id="post-26661" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_no_thumb et_pb_blog_item_0_1 post-26661 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-proclamations">

				
														<h2 class="entry-title">
