											</h2>
				
					<p class="post-meta"><span class="published">May 19, 2024</span></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner"><p>WHEREAS, Emergency Medical Services (EMS) are a vital public service, and reliable access to fast, quality emergency medical care dramatically improves the survival and recovery rate of those who experience sudden and life-threatening illness or injury; and WHEREAS,...</p>
</div><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/emergency-medical-services-week-2/" class="more-link">read more</a></div>			
			</article>
				
			<article id="post-20535" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_no_thumb et_pb_blog_item_0_3 post-20535 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-press-releases">

				
														<h2 class="entry-title">
													<a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/governor-dunleavy-declares-a-disaster-emergency-due-to-severe-winter-storms/">Governor Dunleavy Declares a Disaster Emergency Due to Severe Winter Storms</a>
											</h2>
				
					<p class="post-meta"><span class="published">Jan 5, 2022</span></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner"><p>January 3, 2022 (Anchorage) – The Governor of Alaska Mike Dunleavy, today, declared a disaster emergency in the following Boroughs and areas of the state impacted by severe winter storms, extreme winds, and extreme cold temperatures: • Delta/Greely REAA, and Copper...</p>
</div><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/governor-dunleavy-declares-a-disaster-emergency-due-to-severe-winter-storms/" class="more-link">read more</a></div>			
			</article>
				
