<p>in Alaska and encourage all Alaskans to honor those we lost and those who defended our freedoms on this fateful day 23 years ago by recommitting to live in the spirit of unity and compassion that binds us together as Americans. I order all Alaska State Flags to be flown at half-staff on September 11, 2024 to honor the victims and their families, and all our first responders, caregivers, and servicemen and women who protect the American people every day.</p>
